6. GOLD LAW CONSOLIDATION (JIP-BOUND VERSION)

GL-CORE-1 — Deterministic Pipeline Law

All system operations MUST follow the canonical pipeline order.

No bypassing allowed.


---

GL-CORE-2 — Separation of Concerns Law

Each layer is strictly isolated:

Identity ≠ Meaning

Meaning ≠ Execution

Execution ≠ Governance

Governance ≠ Mirror



---

GL-CORE-3 — Resolution Precedence Law

All conflicts MUST be resolved before MIDAS validation.


---

GL-CORE-4 — Stateless Governance Law

MIDAS cannot store or mutate system state.


---

GL-CORE-5 — Mirror Non-Authority Law

JMS is strictly observational and cannot influence system state.


